   "install": {
    "title": "Installation Using Docker",
    "html": "<p>You can get started with EverShop in minutes by using the Docker image. The Docker image is a great way to get started with EverShop without having to worry about installing dependencies or configuring your environment.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/evershopcommerce/evershop/main/docker-compose.yml &gt; docker-compose.yml\ndocker compose up -d\n</code></pre>\n<p>For the full installation guide, please refer to our <a href=\"https://evershop.io/docs/development/getting-started/installation-guide\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Installation guide</a>.</p>",
